id: axip_region1_disable
label: Disable Encryption and Authentication (AXiP) for Code Region 1
package: platform_core
description: >
  This component should be added to an application when encryption and
  authentication, also known as AXiP, is disabled for Code Region 1. This
  component does not actually disable AXiP, rather it is necessary in order to
  compute the correct memory layout for the application in the event that AXiP
  is disabled. AXiP can be disabled via a DCI command using Simplicity Commander.
category: Platform|Toolchain
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: axip_region1
- name: axip_region1_disable
root_path: platform_core
